text: ["({T}: Add {B} or {G}.)\\nAs Overgrown Tomb enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {B} or {R}.)\\nAs Blood Crypt enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {B} or {R}.)\\nSmoldering Marsh enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', "({T}: Add {G} or {U}.)\\nAs Breeding Pool enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {G} or {W}.)\\nAs Temple Garden enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {G} or {W}.)\\nCanopy Vista enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', "({T}: Add {R} or {G}.)\\nAs Stomping Ground enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {R} or {G}.)\\nCinder Glade enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', "({T}: Add {R} or {W}.)\\nAs Sacred Foundry enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {U} or {B}.)\\nAs Watery Grave enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {U} or {B}.)\\nSunken Hollow enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', "({T}: Add {U} or {R}.)\\nAs Steam Vents enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {W} or {B}.)\\nAs Godless Shrine enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {W} or {U}.)\\nAs Hallowed Fountain enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {W} or {U}.)\\nPrairie Stream enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', 'Colorless Eldrazi spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.\\n{7}, {T}: Search your library for a colorless creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Arid Mesa: Search your library for a Mountain or Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Bloodstained Mire: Search your library for a Swamp or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Flooded Strand: Search your library for a Plains or Island card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Marsh Flats: Search your library for a Plains or Swamp card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Misty Rainforest: Search your library for a Forest or Island card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Polluted Delta: Search your library for an Island or Swamp card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Scalding Tarn: Search your library for an Island or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Verdant Catacombs: Search your library for a Swamp or Forest card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Windswept Heath: Search your library for a Forest or Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Wooded Foothills: Search your library for a Mountain or Forest card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G} or {W}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Horizon Canopy: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\nWhenever you tap Forbidden Orchard for mana, target opponent creates a 1/1 colorless Spirit creature token.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Tectonic Edge: Destroy target nonbasic land. Activate only if an opponent controls four or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt by target attacking creature this turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice a land: Destroy target nonbasic land.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{B/G}, {T}: Add {B}{B}, {B}{G}, or {G}{G}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{B/R}, {T}: Add {B}{B}, {B}{R}, or {R}{R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{G/U}, {T}: Add {G}{G}, {G}{U}, or {U}{U}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{G/W}, {T}: Add {G}{G}, {G}{W}, or {W}{W}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{R/G}, {T}: Add {R}{R}, {R}{G}, or {G}{G}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{R/W}, {T}: Add {R}{R}, {R}{W}, or {W}{W}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Strip Mine: Destroy target land.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Wasteland: Destroy target nonbasic land.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{U/B}, {T}: Add {U}{U}, {U}{B}, or {B}{B}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{U/R}, {T}: Add {U}{U}, {U}{R}, or {R}{R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{W/B}, {T}: Add {W}{W}, {W}{B}, or {B}{B}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{W/U}, {T}: Add {W}{W}, {W}{U}, or {U}{U}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Ancient Tomb deals 2 damage to you.']
