original_text: ["As Blood Crypt enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, Blood Crypt enters the battlefield tapped.", "As Breeding Pool enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, Breeding Pool enters the battlefield tapped.", "As Godless Shrine enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, Godless Shrine enters the battlefield tapped.", "As Hallowed Fountain enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, Hallowed Fountain enters the battlefield tapped.", "As Overgrown Tomb enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, Overgrown Tomb enters the battlefield tapped.", "As Sacred Foundry enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, Sacred Foundry enters the battlefield tapped.", "As Steam Vents enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, Steam Vents enters the battlefield tapped.", "As Stomping Ground enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, Stomping Ground enters the battlefield tapped.", "As Temple Garden enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, Temple Garden enters the battlefield tapped.", "As Watery Grave enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, Watery Grave enters the battlefield tapped.", 'Canopy Vista enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', 'Cinder Glade enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', 'Colorless Eldrazi spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.\\n{7}, {T}: Search your library for a colorless creature card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'Prairie Stream enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', 'Smoldering Marsh enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', 'Sunken Hollow enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Arid Mesa: Search your library for a Mountain or Plains card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Bloodstained Mire: Search your library for a Swamp or Mountain card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Flooded Strand: Search your library for a Plains or Island card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Marsh Flats: Search your library for a Plains or Swamp card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Misty Rainforest: Search your library for a Forest or Island card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Polluted Delta: Search your library for an Island or Swamp card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Scalding Tarn: Search your library for an Island or Mountain card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Verdant Catacombs: Search your library for a Swamp or Forest card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Windswept Heath: Search your library for a Forest or Plains card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Wooded Foothills: Search your library for a Mountain or Forest card and put it onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G} or {W} to your mana pool.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Horizon Canopy: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.\\nWhenever you tap Forbidden Orchard for mana, target opponent puts a 1/1 colorless Spirit creature token onto the battlefield.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Tectonic Edge: Destroy target nonbasic land. Activate this ability only if an opponent controls four or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt by target attacking creature this turn.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice a land: Destroy target nonbasic land.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{BG}, {T}: Add {B}{B}, {B}{G}, or {G}{G} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{BR}, {T}: Add {B}{B}, {B}{R}, or {R}{R} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{GU}, {T}: Add {R}{R}, {R}{W}, or {W}{W} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{GW}, {T}: Add {G}{G}, {G}{U}, or {U}{U} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{RG}, {T}: Add {R}{R}, {R}{G}, or {G}{G} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{RW}, {T}: Add {G}{G}, {G}{W}, or {W}{W} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Strip Mine: Destroy target land.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Wasteland: Destroy target nonbasic land.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{UB}, {T}: Add {U}{U}, {U}{B}, or {B}{B} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{UR}, {T}: Add {U}{U}, {U}{R}, or {R}{R} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{WB}, {T}: Add {W}{W}, {W}{B}, or {B}{B} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{WU}, {T}: Add {W}{W}, {W}{U}, or {U}{U} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {C}{C} to your mana pool. Ancient Tomb deals 2 damage to you.']
